        DescriptionText:
          ClassType1: TEXT
          String: |-
            Useful for Post Effect graphs, transitions from Inner Color to Outer Color along a direction of increasing distance to the Center Offset point. Inner Radius controls the size of the circle. 
            
            The lower the Softness value the sharper the results will become. If you prefer a non stretched result, rescale the Scale value according to the resolution.
